    <description>A library providing methods for matching and filtering text. It supports glob patterns, regular expressions, and fuzzy matching.</description>
    <releaseNotes>## v1.5.42 (patch)

Changes since v1.5.41:

- Bump the ktsu group with 2 updates ([@dependabot[bot]](https://github.com/dependabot[bot]))</releaseNotes>
    <copyright>Copyright (c) 2023-2026 ktsu-dev contributors</copyright>
